Binary distribution and reproducible inputs / 二进制分发与构建输入:

The Git repository contains source, text and documentation images; executable
payloads are distributed as release inputs. GunyahVM's own release
attachment gunyahvm-1.0.0-inputs.tar.zst contains three binary files: crosvm,
windows/firmware.fd and windows/winpe-helper.exe, with the original component
licences and this NOTICE under notices/. Its URL, archive SHA-256
and per-file sizes/hashes are pinned in tools/prebuilt.lock.json.
源码仓库存放源码、文本和文档图片；输入附件含上述三个可执行组件及原始许可证和 NOTICE，
归档与逐文件哈希均锁定。

crosvm uses the upstream/minijail commits above, iceland-gvm patches
0001-0030 and maintained patches 0031 (quiet closed shutdown channel) and
0032 (bounded child teardown), in third_party/crosvm/patches/series.
Toolchain: Rust/Cargo 1.88.0, GCC 13.3.0 ARM64 cross compiler,
binutils 2.42, LLVM/libclang 18.1.3, Ubuntu 26.04 ARM64 sysroot.
Exact package versions, source archives, flags and hashes are pinned in
tools/crosvm.lock.json; features gunyah,net,vnc, no default features.

UEFI uses the edk2-gunyah/edk2 commits above, pinned submodules and
third_party/windows/patches/0005-VirtioBlkDxe-bound-DMA-requests-to-4MiB.patch.
RELEASE build: GCC 13.3.0 cross compiler, binutils 2.42, ACPICA/IASL
20230628 and Python 3.12.3, with fixed stack-cookie tables; exact inputs in tools/windows.lock.json.

WinPE helper: yzddmr6's MIT source, inherited from the Xiaomi Pad 8 Pro
mainline port, now src/gunyahvm/windows/winpe-helper.c. Rebuilt for
GunyahVM guest paths with Clang/LLD/llvm-dlltool 18.1.3, freestanding
ARM64 PE and no Windows SDK. See tools/build-winpe-helper.py.

Signed drivers are fetched directly from their public upstream attachment:
https://github.com/Droid-VM/gunyah-guest-drivers-windows/releases/download/dev/gunyah-arm64-drivers.zip
Immutable GitHub asset ID: 558946077; source commit as listed above.
Only rdmapool, pvmpower, viostor, NetKVM, vioinput and DroidVM_Test.cer
are selected, byte-for-byte, using assets/windows/driver-files.json.
They are not included in GunyahVM's input archive. Their signatures and
public test certificate remain upstream's; no private signing keys are used.
签名驱动直接取上游附件，逐文件原样校验；不装入自有输入包。

See docs/building.md and docs/building.zh-CN.md for the download/cache
